espace\\u200e \\n\\nNo matches found \\n\\n/ \\n\\nProject slug \\n\\nPick a group or namespace where you want to create this project. \\n\\n**root / root** is a project that you can use to add a README to your GitLab profile. Create a public project and initialize the repository with a README to get started. [ Learn more ](/help/user/profile/index.md#add-details-to-your-profile-with-a-readme) . \\n\\nVisibility Level [ ](/help/user/public_access.md)\\n\\nPrivate \\n\\nProject access must be granted explicitly to each user. If this project is part of a group, access is granted to members of the group.  Not allowed by administrators \\n\\nInternal \\n\\nThe project can be accessed by any logged in user except external users.  Not allowed by administrators \\n\\nPublic \\n\\nThe project can be accessed without any authentication.  Not allowed by administrators \\n\\nProject Configuration \\n\\nInitialize repository with a README \\n\\nAllows you to immediately clone this project\u2019s repository. Skip this if you plan to push up an existing repository. \\n\\nEnable Static Application Security Testing (SAST) \\n\\nAnalyze your source code for known security vulnerabilities. [ Learn more. ](/help/user/application_security/sast/index.md)\\n\\nCreate project  [ Cancel  ](/dashboard/groups)\\n\\nLearn how to [ contribute to the built-in templates ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/contributing)\\n\\n  * Built-in  32 \\n\\n\\n\\n**Ruby on Rails**   \\n\\n\\nIncludes an MVC structure, Gemfile, Rakefile, along with many others, to help you get started \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/rails) Use template \\n\\n**Spring**   \\n\\n\\nIncludes an MVC structure, mvnw and pom.xml to help you get started \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-templates/spring) Use template \\n\\n**NodeJS Express**   \\n\\n\\nIncludes an MVC structure to help you get started \\n\\n[ Preview  ](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/project-te